 {
  "slug": "lheure-doree",
  "title": "L'Heure Dorée | French Touch & Chic Grooves",
  "sc_url": "https://soundcloud.com/potenyzr1nma/lheure-doree-french-touch-chic",
  "dur": "1:36:06",
  "cover": "mix-lheure-doree.jpg",
  "tracks": [],
  "desc_en": [
   "\"L'Heure Dorée\" (The Golden Hour) is a 90-minute sonic journey that captures the essence of effortless Parisian chic. Starting with the warm, vintage crackle of French Chanson and Bossa Nova, the set slowly transitions into the breezy, spatial sounds of modern French Pop. As the afternoon turns into early evening, the energy naturally shifts, diving deep into the sophisticated grooves of Nu-Disco and closing with a masterclass selection of classic French Touch and Filter House.",
   "From the elegant cafés of the Left Bank to the hidden, underground clubs of Le Marais. Pour yourself a glass of natural wine, sit back, and let the groove take over."
  ],
  "desc_zh": [
   "「L'Heure Dorée」（黃金時刻）是一段 90 分鐘的聲音旅程，捕捉不費力的巴黎式優雅。從法國香頌與巴薩諾瓦溫暖的老唱片雜音開始，漸漸過渡到現代法式流行輕盈、開闊的聲響。隨著午後轉入傍晚，能量自然轉換，深入 Nu-Disco 精緻的律動，最後以經典 French Touch 與 Filter House 的精選收尾。",
   "從左岸優雅的咖啡館，到瑪黑區隱密的地下俱樂部。倒一杯自然酒，放鬆下來，讓律動接管。"
  ],
  "credits": [
   {
    "en": "A special thanks to Atelier MHO for the invitation",
    "zh": "特別感謝 Atelier MHO 的邀請"
   },
   {
    "en": "Cover credit to @cjcjnstagram",
    "zh": "封面：@cjcjnstagram"
   }
  ],
