  "desc_en": [
   "Music slowly unfolds in the mountains,<br>moving with the light,<br>rhythm emerging from the earth,<br>the afternoon air still bright,<br>footsteps wandering through the forest,<br>the body responding gently to the beat.",
   "Music is only one part of the scene,<br>existing alongside tree shadows, clouds, wind and conversation,<br>slowly taking shape in the mountains."
  ],
  "desc_zh": [
   "音樂在山裡慢慢展開，<br>陪著光線移動，<br>節奏從土地裡浮現，<br>午後空氣的仍亮，<br>腳步在山林間上來回，<br>身體順著節奏微微回應。",
   "音樂只是場景的一部分，<br>與樹影、雲層、風聲、談話聲一起存在，<br>在山裡，慢慢完成。"
  ],
